se style="v" number="14" sid="JOB 41:14" />Who has opened <char style="w" strong="H6440">the</char> doors <char style="w" strong="H6440">of</char> <char style="w" strong="H6440">his</char> <char style="w" strong="H6440">face</char>? <char style="w" strong="H6440">Around</char> <char style="w" strong="H6440">his</char> teeth [<char style="w" strong="H6440">are</char>] terrible. <verse eid="JOB 41:14" /><verse style="v" number="15" sid="JOB 41:15" /><char style="w" strong="H3068">A</char> pride—<char style="w" strong="H4651">strong</char> ones <char style="w" strong="H5921">of</char> shields, || Shut <char style="w" strong="H5921">up</char>—<char style="w" strong="H3068">a</char> <char style="w" strong="H1692">close</char> seal. <verse eid="JOB 41:15" /><verse style="v" number="16" sid="JOB 41:16" /><char style="w" strong="H3820">They</char> draw near <char style="w" strong="H3820">to</char> one another, || <char style="w" strong="H3820">And</char> air does not enter between them. <verse eid="JOB 41:16" /><verse style="v" number="17" sid="JOB 41:17" /><char style="w" strong="H7667">They</char> adhere <char style="w" strong="H1481">to</char> one another, || <char style="w" strong="H7667">They</char> stick <char style="w" strong="H1481">together</char> <char style="w" strong="H2398">and</char> are not separated. <verse eid="JOB 41:17" /><verse style="v" number="18" sid="JOB 41:18" /><char style="w" strong="H6965">His</char> sneezings cause light <char style="w" strong="H6965">to</char> shine, || <char style="w" strong="H6965">And</char> <char style="w" strong="H6965">his</char> eyes [<char style="w" strong="H2719">are</char>] <char style="w" strong="H6965">as</char> <char style="w" strong="H6965">the</char> eyelids <char style="w" strong="H2719">of</char> <char style="w" strong="H6965">the</char> dawn. <verse eid="JOB 41:18" /><verse style="v" number="19" sid="JOB 41:19" />Flames go <char style="w" strong="H2803">out</char> <char style="w" strong="H6086">of</char> <char style="w" strong="H2803">his</char> mouth, sparks <char style="w" strong="H6086">of</char> fire escape. <verse eid="JOB 41:19" /><verse style="v" number="20" sid="JOB 41:20" />Smoke goes forth <char style="w" strong="H3808">out</char> <char style="w" strong="H1121">of</char> <char style="w" strong="H3808">his</char> nostrils, || <char style="w" strong="H1121">As</char> <char style="w" strong="H3068">a</char> blown pot <char style="w" strong="H1121">and</char> reeds. <verse eid="JOB 41:20" /><verse style="v" number="21" sid="JOB 41:21" /><char style="w" strong="H2803">His</char> breath sets coals on fire, || <char style="w" strong="H7494">And</char> <char style="w" strong="H3068">a</char> flame goes forth from <char style="w" strong="H2803">his</char> mouth. <verse eid="JOB 41:21" /><verse style="v" number="22" sid="JOB 41:22" />Strength lodges <char style="w" strong="H5921">in</char> <char style="w" strong="H5921">his</char> neck, || <char style="w" strong="H8478">And</char> grief exults <char style="w" strong="H5921">before</char> <char style="w" strong="H5921">him</char>. <verse eid="JOB 41:22" /><verse style="v" number="23" sid="JOB 41:23" /><char style="w" strong="H7760">The</char> flakes <char style="w" strong="H3220">of</char> <char style="w" strong="H7760">his</char> flesh have adhered—Firm <char style="w" strong="H7760">on</char> <char style="w" strong="H7760">him</char>—<char style="w" strong="H7760">it</char> is <char style="w" strong="H7760">not</char> moved. <verse eid="JOB 41:23" /><verse style="v" number="24" sid="JOB 41:24" /><char style="w" strong="H2803">His</char> heart [<char style="w" strong="H8415">is</char>] firm <char style="w" strong="H2803">as</char> <char style="w" strong="H3068">a</char> stone, || Indeed, firm <char style="w" strong="H2803">as</char> <char style="w" strong="H2803">the</char> lower piece. <verse eid="JOB 41:24" /><verse style="v" number="25" sid="JOB 41:25" /><char style="w" strong="H5921">The</char> mighty <char style="w" strong="H6213">are</char> afraid <char style="w" strong="H5921">at</char> <char style="w" strong="H5921">his</char> rising, || <char style="w" strong="H5921">From</char> <char style="w" strong="H5921">his</char> breakings <char style="w" strong="H5921">they</char> <char style="w" strong="H6213">keep</char> <char style="w" strong="H6213">themselves</char> free. <verse eid="JOB 41:25" /><verse style="v" number="26" sid="JOB 41:26" /><char style="w" strong="H3605">The</char> sword <char style="w" strong="H1121">of</char> <char style="w" strong="H3605">his</char> overtaker does <char style="w" strong="H7200">not</char> stand, || Spear, dart, <char style="w" strong="H1121">and</char> breastplate. <verse eid="JOB 41:26" /><verse style="v" number="27" sid="JOB 41:27" />He reckons iron as straw, bronze as rotten wood.
<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /><verse style="v" number="28" sid="JOB 41:28" />The son of the bow does not cause him to flee, || Stones of the sling are turned into stubble by him.
<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /><verse style="v" number="29" sid="JOB 41:29" />Darts have been reckoned as stubble, || And he laughs at the shaking of <char style="w" strong="H3068">a</char> javelin. <verse eid="JOB 41:29" /><verse style="v" number="30" sid="JOB 41:30" />Sharp points of clay [are] under him, || He spreads gold on the mire.
<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /><verse style="v" number="31" sid="JOB 41:31" />He causes the deep to boil as <char style="w" strong="H3068">a</char> pot, || He makes the sea as <char style="w" strong="H3068">a</char> pot of ointment. <verse eid="JOB 41:31" /><verse style="v" number="32" sid="JOB 41:32" />He causes <char style="w" strong="H3068">a</char> path to shine after him, || One thinks the deep to be hoary. <verse eid="JOB 41:32" /><verse style="v" number="33" sid="JOB 41:33" />There is not on the earth his like, || That is made without terror.
<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /><verse style="v" number="34" sid="JOB 41:34" />He sees every high thing, || He [is] king over all sons of pride.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter style="c" number="42" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="p"><verse style="v" number="1" sid="JOB 42:1" /><char style="w" strong="H3068">And</char> Job <char style="w" strong="H6030">answers</char> <char style="w" strong="H3068">YHWH</char> <char style="w" strong="H3068">and</char> says: <verse eid="JOB 42:1" /><verse style="v" number="2" sid="JOB 42:2" />“<char style="w" strong="H3588">You</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">have</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">known</char> <char style="w" strong="H3588">that</char> [<char style="w" strong="H3588">for</char>] <char style="w" strong="H3605">all</char> <char style="w" strong="H3605">things</char> <char style="w" strong="H3588">You</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">are</char> <char style="w" strong="H3201">able</char>, || <char style="w" strong="H3045">And</char> <char style="w" strong="H3808">no</char> <char style="w" strong="H4209">purpose</char> <char style="w" strong="H3605">is</char> withheld <char style="w" strong="H4480">from</char> <char style="w" strong="H3588">You</char>. <verse eid="JOB 42:2" /><verse style="v" number="3" sid="JOB 42:3" />[<char style="w" strong="H3045">You</char> <char style="w" strong="H3651">said</char>], <char style="w" strong="H4310">Who</char> [<char style="w" strong="H2088">is</char>] <char style="w" strong="H2088">this</char> hiding <char style="w" strong="H6098">counsel</char> <char style="w" strong="H3808">without</char> <char style="w" strong="H1847">knowledge</char>? <char style="w" strong="H3651">Therefore</char>, <char style="w" strong="H3651">I</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">have</char> <char style="w" strong="H5046">declared</char>, <char style="w" strong="H3045">and</char> <char style="w" strong="H4310">do</char> <char style="w" strong="H3808">not</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">understand</char>, || <char style="w" strong="H4480">Too</char> <char style="w" strong="H6381">wonderful</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">for</char> <char style="w" strong="H5046">me</char>, <char style="w" strong="H3045">and</char> <char style="w" strong="H3651">I</char> <char style="w" strong="H4310">do</char> <char style="w" strong="H3808">not</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">know</char>. <verse eid="JOB 42:3" /><verse style="v" number="4" sid="JOB 42:4" /><char style="w" strong="H4994">Please</char> <char style="w" strong="H8085">hear</char>, <char style="w" strong="H8085">and</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">I</char> <char style="w" strong="H1696">speak</char>; [<char style="w" strong="H3045">You</char> <char style="w" strong="H1696">said</char>], <char style="w" strong="H3045">I</char> <char style="w" strong="H7592">ask</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">you</char>, <char style="w" strong="H8085">and</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">you</char> cause <char style="w" strong="H4994">Me</char> <char style="w" strong="H1696">to</char> <char style="w" strong="H3045">know</char>. <verse eid="JOB 42:4" /><verse style="v" number="5" sid="JOB 42:5" /><char style="w" strong="H5869">By</char> <char style="w" strong="H8085">the</char> <char style="w" strong="H8085">hearing</char> <char style="w" strong="H5869">of</char> <char style="w" strong="H8085">the</char> <char style="w" strong="H8085">ear</char> <char style="w" strong="H6258">I</char> <char style="w" strong="H8085">heard</char> <char style="w" strong="H7200">You</char>, || <char style="w" strong="H5869">And</char> <char style="w" strong="H6258">now</char> <char style="w" strong="H8085">my</char> <char style="w" strong="H5869">eye</char> <char style="w" strong="H5869">has</char> <char style="w" strong="H7200">seen</char> <char style="w" strong="H7200">You</char>. <verse eid="JOB 42:5" /><verse style="v" number="6" sid="JOB 42:6" /><char style="w" strong="H3651">Therefore</char> <char style="w" strong="H5921">I</char> <char style="w" strong="H3988">loathe</char> [<char style="w" strong="H5921">it</char>], || <char style="w" strong="H6083">And</char> <char style="w" strong="H5921">I</char> <char style="w" strong="H5162">have</char> sighed <char style="w" strong="H5921">on</char> <char style="w" strong="H6083">dust</char> <char style="w" strong="H6083">and</char> <char style="w" strong="H6083">ashes</char>.” <verse eid="JOB 42:6" /><verse style="v" number="7" sid="JOB 42:7" /><char style="w" strong="H3068">And</char> <char style="w" strong="H3588">it</char> <char style="w" strong="H1961">comes</char> <char style="w" strong="H1696">to</char> <char style="w" strong="H1961">pass</char> <char style="w" strong="H1961">after</char> <char style="w" strong="H3068">YHWH</char>’s <char style="w" strong="H1696">speaking</char> <char style="w" strong="H1696">these</char> <char style="w" strong="H1697">words</char> <char style="w" strong="H1696">to</char> <char style="w" strong="H3808">Job</char>, <char style="w" strong="H3588">that</char> <char style="w" strong="H3068">YHWH</char> <char style="w" strong="H1696">says</char> <char style="w" strong="H1696">to</char> Eliphaz <char style="w" strong="H3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="H8489">Temanite</char>, “<char style="w" strong="H3068">My</char> anger <char style="w" strong="H3068">has</char> <char style="w" strong="H2734">burned</char> <char style="w" strong="H2734">against</char> <char style="w" strong="H3588">you</char> <char style="w" strong="H3068">and</char> <char style="w" strong="H2734">against</char> <char style="w" strong="H3068">your</char> <char style="w" strong="H8147">two</char> <char style="w" strong="H7453">friends</char>, <char style="w" strong="H3588">because</char> <char style="w" strong="H3588">you</char> <char style="w" strong="H1961">have</char> <char style="w" strong="H3808">not</char> <char style="w" strong="H1696">spoken</char> correctly <char style="w" strong="H1697">concerning</char> <char style="w" strong="H1696">Me</char>, <char style="w" strong="H1961">like</char> <char style="w" strong="H3068">My</char> <char style="w" strong="H5650">servant</char> <char style="w" strong="H3808">Job</char>. <vers